wns on b5 and c4 stand, and the long diagonal is shut. [%csl Rd5][%cal Rg2d5] }) 9... Nxc6 10. Bxc6+ Bd7 11. Bxa8 Qxa8 12. O-O { A rook for a bishop, the exchange, is yours, and the pawns are level; he has two bishops and the middle for it. [%csl Re8] } 1-0


